diff --git a/tools/vintage-solo/DOOMSDAY.md b/tools/vintage-solo/DOOMSDAY.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6d329e9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tools/vintage-solo/DOOMSDAY.md
@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+# Doomsday: source and current limits
+
+Fourth selectable deck for both players, including mirrors. Exact 60-card main
+from SingPanMan, Vintage Challenge 16, 2026-08-23, third place (6-1).
+Source: https://www.mtggoldfish.com/deck/download/7923523
+Event summary: https://www.mtggoldfish.com/archetype/vintage-doomsday
+Retrieved 2026-09-10. Sideboard deliberately omitted. All 30 unique scripts
+are present; 60-card counts and restricted/banned checks pass pinned Forge data.
+Live external legality was not independently revalidated against current WotC B/R.
+
+Bot uses conservative pass-turn Recall/Lotus/Oracle/Force/Ponder pile, actual
+Forge search and reverse insertion order. It checks known missing roles, blue
+land, public locks and worst-case opposing power against remaining life.
+It cannot predict concealed answers. Other Doomsday piles are not implemented.
+Demonic Consultation is held rather than guessing a dangerous name. This limits
+bot strength. Do not claim a win rate or full support until matches are measured.
+All 84 distinct main-deck cards have Russian text with original English names;
+new translations are custom, not claimed as official printed text. No card scripts or rules modified for AI convenience.
+
+Card policies live in VintageCardRules and are called by AiController.canPlaySa.
+Forge still checks timing, restrictions, legal targets and actual costs/payment.
+Gaea's Blessing: target self, prioritize Atraxa/Recall/Walk/Oath/answers; refuse
+unsafe draw or useless recycling with ample hand. Its library-to-graveyard
+trigger uses the existing engine and is not suppressed by spell policy.
+Probe: empty opposing hand allowed for cantrip; empty own library/draw locks
+refused. Blue mana only (existing AIPhyrexianPayment Never); no speculative
+life payment. Target hand is read only by Forge when spell resolves.
+Trap: all legal hostile spells including copies, never own spells/abilities;
+refuse zero targets or one low-priority spell. Important engines, removal and
+counters prioritized. Free alternate cost and taxes remain engine-controlled.
+
+Tests: VintageCardsRegressionTest plus VintageManaRegressionTest. CI command:
+mvn -B -pl forge-gui-desktop -am '-Dtest=Vintage*RegressionTest' -DfailIfNoTests=false -Dsurefire.failIfNoSpecifiedTests=false test
