@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+# Russian card text
+
+This distribution translates the 67 distinct cards in the three bundled decks,
+the reverse face of Witch Enchanter, Undercity and associated tokens/effects.
+It does not translate Forge's entire external card database.
+
+The bundled pinned Forge Oracle text is the source. These are custom Russian
+translations, not a claim of official localized printings. English canonical
+names are retained in parentheses. Card scripts, internal names, costs, deck
+identities and legality data are unchanged. Terms including mana value,
+additional versus alternative costs, counters, tokens, exile and targets are
+kept distinct. Full English rules remain in the source scripts.
+
+Roboto-Bold.ttf is already bundled upstream and contains Cyrillic. The old
+skin font1.ttf does not. Russian now selects Roboto and a new locale-specific
+bitmap font cache name to prevent stale Latin-only caches on app updates.
+
+Coverage was checked locally. Rendering and dynamic stack text need Android
+verification; dynamic choice strings can still fall back to English.
+
+2026-09-10: extended to all 84 distinct cards across four decks, including
+17 Doomsday-only cards; complete Oracle mana-symbol counts checked locally.
